Book SCMO_0003, decision no. 10 of 410 (full window 2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-30), made at the close of 2019-03-08 (Friday). Chosen by a stated rule and not for its result: the first week of the full window in which the rule is IN,
the three-index switch is OUT and the rule trades (a state event), read from decisions.csv in decision order. Everything below is printed from the evidence files; the stock prices come from the approved OHLC file (D18).

Step 1. The basket in force on 2019-03-08: the latest non-skipped basket with availableDate on or before it = the basket of 2018-12-17; 10 stocks with listed weight > 0 (weights renormalised to sum to 1, as in T06).
Step 2. Tag every stock as of 2019-03-08 (the shared tag rule, latest snapshot on or before the date; 'rank' = rank on the market-cap snapshot, 1-100 Large, 101-250 Mid, above 250 Small and below; before 2026-04-09 only the rank rule exists):
