Step 7. The path: NAV_t = sum of units x close (stocks) + GOLDBEES units x close + cash units x level. The rule's path runs 2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-30, 1,932 sessions, end NAV 6.6343.
        CAGR = 6.6343 ^ (252 / 1931) - 1 = 28.01%. Max drawdown = min over t of NAV_t / (max NAV up to t) - 1 = -20.17% (peak 4.7480 on 2024-09-30, trough 3.7903 on 2025-01-14); Calmar = 28.01% / 20.17% = 1.389.
Step 8. The comparators on the same path (2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-30, 20.8 bps): three-index switch CAGR 28.41%, max drawdown -18.42%; hold the parent CAGR 16.21%, max drawdown -46.32%. No chance benchmark was run.

